      "text": "This is the first rational explanation I've seen for deploying OpenClaw: https://t.co/Hj3tCbqC12 https://t.co/VYCeGvQb1g",
      "author_name": "Ian Andrews",
      "author_handle": "@IanAndrewsDC",
